# Data cache — heavy and fully reproducible from `python -m quantlab.data.ingest`
data/cache/
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
*.parquet

# NOTE: reports/figures/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The generated research report
# references those PNGs, and committing them is what makes reports/research_report.md
# render with its charts on GitHub. Regenerate with `python scripts/generate_report.py`.

